*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%%%% PPD File for Zebra ZD420 - Custom 80x100mm
*%%%% Cleaned for Google Workspace (No Filters)
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ZD420_80x100.ppd"
*Product: "(Zebra ZD420)"
*Manufacturer: "Zebra"
*ModelName: "Zebra ZD420 (80x100mm)"
*ShortNickName: "Zebra ZD420"
*NickName: "Zebra ZD420 Custom Label"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% --- SEZIONE FORMATI CARTA ---
*% Dimensioni calcolate: 80mm = 227 punti, 100mm = 283 punti

*OpenGroup: General/General

*% 1. Impostazione PageSize
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Label80x100
*PageSize Label80x100/Etichetta 8x10cm: "<</PageSize[227 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*% 2. Impostazione PageRegion
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Label80x100
*PageRegion Label80x100/Etichetta 8x10cm: "<</PageSize[227 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% 3. Impostazione ImageableArea (Area Stampabile)
*DefaultImageableArea: Label80x100
*ImageableArea Label80x100/Etichetta 8x10cm: "0 0 227 283"

*% 4. Impostazione PaperDimension (Dimensione Fisica)
*DefaultPaperDimension: Label80x100
*PaperDimension Label80x100/Etichetta 8x10cm: "227 283"

*CloseGroup: General

*% --- ALTRE IMPOSTAZIONI ---

*% Risoluzione (Default 203dpi, modificabile se hai la versione 300dpi)
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/PreRenderingEnhance false>> setpagedevice"
*Resolution 300dpi/300dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/PreRenderingEnhance false>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Scurezza (Darkness) - Aumenta se la stampa è chiara
*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 15
*Darkness 10/10: ""
*Darkness 15/15: ""
*Darkness 20/20: ""
*Darkness 25/25: ""
*Darkness 30/30: ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*% Velocità di stampa
*OpenUI *PrintSpeed/Print Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PrintSpeed
*DefaultPrintSpeed: 4
*PrintSpeed 2/2 ips: ""
*PrintSpeed 3/3 ips: ""
*PrintSpeed 4/4 ips: ""
*PrintSpeed 5/5 ips: ""
*PrintSpeed 6/6 ips: ""
*CloseUI: *PrintSpeed